# Encounter overrides for the Command Module (I28; our own data, see
# crates/session/src/encounters.rs; never written into the game install).
#
# The Endar Spire's first fights are the story's tutorial: KOTOR makes the
# Sith harmless (one-damage weapons) and scripts the Jedi duel and Bandon,
# and that stays so (I22 section 11). Only co-op scales them: each player
# past the first adds half again of every hostile's maximum.
per_player hp x0.5
